 (#stage-landing)

- src/stage: StageWorld loads a pre-rendered backdrop in the game's own
  projection, sprite slices for structures a character can walk behind,
  and a 0.125 m collision mask kept apart from the picture
- StageController: start card, exit at the facility entrance, events and
  calls for a combat system (no combat code of its own)
- small hooks in main.js, game.js and renderer.js
- public/stages/mustafar_landing: exported from mustafar-blender v0.4_stage
  (A3b working layout, not a confirmed film reconstruction)

